      "content": "i mean i get that but i already took like half a scoop of the pre-workout... i feel fine though, just a little restless. my heart is beating a bit fast but that's probably just the caffeine kicking in? i dont really want to go to the doctor for just some itchy skin, it seems like overkill. is it really that bad if i just finish my sets and then take an antihistamine later?",
